【Convenient and safe】This 110v to 220v converter housing is made of flame retardant material, waterproof and drop resistant. This power transformer has a back hook setting to support wall mounting and easy placement. To use, plug the voltage transformer into the power supply, connect the appliance you need to use to the converter, press the converter switch, and you can use it quickly. 【Protection device】 voltage power transformer built-in temperature control protection, due to long-term overload use resulting in high temperature, the Power Voltage Converter can automatically cut off the power to protect the appliances, use more secure. 【Use Range】500W CE/FCC certified power supply voltage conversion transformer can step up the voltage from 100V-120V to 220V-240V, supporting the use of appliances in the United States in the UK, Europe, China and other regions. However, please allow at least 20% for power surges/spikes. 【Maximum use power】This voltage converter production standard is full power output. According to the principle of transformer use, it is recommended that you use the maximum power of 80% of the transformer.for example, 500W transformer maximum use power is 500 * 0.8 = 400W. 【About frequency】 the rated frequency of this voltage converter is 50/60Hz, if the frequency of the appliance does not match the frequency of the voltage converter, the appliance will also not work. 【Suggestions for use】 According to the experimental conclusion of the voltage converter, for hot pot and other appliances that need to be used continuously for more than 90 minutes, please purchase a voltage converter that exceeds two times the power of the appliance.
